WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:22.230 --> 00:23.390
I've spent my whole life

3
00:23.390 --> 00:25.050
drawing precise blueprints,

4
00:25.390 --> 00:28.280
but I can't draw clear boundaries in life.

5
00:30.030 --> 00:33.470
Right and wrong are clear in blueprints,

6
00:34.670 --> 00:36.640
but human hearts and life itself

7
00:37.030 --> 00:39.280
are all shades of gray.

8
00:41.560 --> 00:44.200
This space between black and white

9
00:44.280 --> 00:46.790
is never a place to linger.

10
00:47.140 --> 00:48.680
It's purgatory,

11
00:51.710 --> 00:53.070
and I've been

12
00:53.640 --> 00:55.560
trapped in it for a long time,

13
00:56.280 --> 00:59.150
unable to move forward or go back.

14
00:59.170 --> 01:00.410
Chen...

15
02:33.470 --> 02:38.240
[LIGHT THE DARK]

16
02:38.700 --> 02:41.430
[Episode 2]

17
02:43.560 --> 02:44.240
They thought

18
02:44.240 --> 02:45.240
they could just find someone

19
02:45.240 --> 02:46.280
to send me away,

20
02:46.280 --> 02:46.900
and I wouldn't know

21
02:46.900 --> 02:48.150
what kind of conspiracy

22
02:48.150 --> 02:49.280
they were plotting?

23
02:49.750 --> 02:50.520
You weren't there.

24
02:50.520 --> 02:51.560
How do you know

25
02:51.710 --> 02:52.960
what they said?

26
02:53.400 --> 02:54.310
I... I've been in the plant

27
02:54.310 --> 02:55.310
for so many years.

28
02:55.680 --> 02:57.010
Even if I weren't there,

29
02:57.190 --> 02:58.920
I could still get information.

30
03:01.800 --> 03:02.860
They just wanted to

31
03:02.910 --> 03:04.590
shift the responsibility

32
03:04.840 --> 03:06.000
for the Project 713 accident

33
03:06.000 --> 03:07.120
onto Chen Fu.

34
03:08.240 --> 03:10.080
Do you know what charge they made up?

35
03:10.080 --> 03:11.280
Improper operation.

36
03:12.470 --> 03:13.280
How wicked.

37
03:13.710 --> 03:15.220
The whole plant knows

38
03:15.590 --> 03:16.920
Chen Fu is good at his job

39
03:17.560 --> 03:18.690
and has principles.

40
03:19.000 --> 03:19.840
If they try to pin the blame on him like this,

41
03:19.840 --> 03:21.240
no one will believe them.

42
03:21.430 --> 03:23.400
They're using Chen Fu as a scapegoat.

43
03:23.400 --> 03:24.120
Do you know why

44
03:24.120 --> 03:25.450
they didn't ask me to go?

45
03:26.750 --> 03:27.400
Because they know

46
03:27.400 --> 03:29.329
my relationship with your family.

47
03:29.800 --> 03:32.800
If I had been there, I would have definitely objected.

48
03:35.150 --> 03:35.910
Wenying.

49
03:36.840 --> 03:37.850
You usually

50
03:38.560 --> 03:40.400
are quite close to the director.

51
03:41.079 --> 03:42.410
Whatever they are up to,

52
03:42.710 --> 03:44.310
you should have an idea.

53
03:44.910 --> 03:45.910
Geng Jian, I...

54
03:45.910 --> 03:46.710
-I know. I know. -I...

55
03:46.710 --> 03:47.590
I know...

56
03:47.870 --> 03:49.470
I know what you're thinking.

57
03:49.590 --> 03:51.320
-You don't need to tell me. -No.

58
03:51.470 --> 03:52.930
I said those words just now

59
03:53.560 --> 03:54.360
to prepare you

60
03:54.360 --> 03:55.620
for what might happen.

61
04:12.310 --> 04:14.030
I didn't find Dad's work notes

62
04:14.030 --> 04:15.430
or the flange fragments.

63
04:16.190 --> 04:17.510
But I found this.

64
04:27.190 --> 04:28.650
This is a gift Dad gave you.

65
04:34.560 --> 04:35.360
Shan.

66
04:36.120 --> 04:38.420
I know you're going to work in Guangdong.

67
04:38.630 --> 04:39.680
I support you.

68
04:40.120 --> 04:40.870
Go for it.

69
05:06.670 --> 05:10.760
Dad bought this for me to learn English.

70
05:17.360 --> 05:18.740
Thanks to this gift,

71
05:21.000 --> 05:21.910
I recorded some

72
05:21.930 --> 05:22.860
crucial things.

73
05:23.950 --> 05:24.790
Today,

74
05:24.920 --> 05:26.720
Wan Yang gathered his own people

75
05:27.270 --> 05:28.730
and held a secret meeting.

76
05:29.160 --> 05:29.950
Listen.

77
05:35.510 --> 05:36.600
Alright, today all departments

78
05:36.600 --> 05:37.600
are in agreement.

79
05:37.680 --> 05:39.800
The Project 713 explosion

80
05:40.000 --> 05:42.460
was caused by improper operation on the part

81
05:42.510 --> 05:44.800
-of Chen Fu from the construction team. -They're slandering him!

82
05:44.800 --> 05:45.950
Captain Chen Fu...

83
05:46.120 --> 05:47.320
Keep your voice down!

84
05:47.630 --> 05:49.030
They clearly want to blame everything

85
05:49.030 --> 05:49.830
on Dad.

86
05:50.830 --> 05:53.190
They even thought of all kinds of countermeasures.

87
05:53.190 --> 05:54.450
I'm going to find them.

88
05:54.680 --> 05:55.480
Shan!

89
05:55.630 --> 05:56.430
Shan!

90
05:56.480 --> 05:58.330
Shan, don't be impulsive!

91
05:59.480 --> 06:00.270
Godfather?

92
06:04.800 --> 06:06.950
From now on, this family will have to

93
06:07.510 --> 06:09.120
rely on you two.

94
06:10.120 --> 06:11.780
Take good care of your mother.

95
06:13.070 --> 06:14.670
It's okay. You still have me.

96
06:16.270 --> 06:17.310
I'll go back now.

97
06:18.070 --> 06:19.130
Shan, I'm leaving.

98
06:24.120 --> 06:25.380
Take care, Godfather.

99
06:28.480 --> 06:29.270
Mom.

100
06:30.360 --> 06:32.310
The food is ready. Have some.

101
06:33.800 --> 06:34.920
You guys eat first.

102
06:35.000 --> 06:36.330
I'm going out for a walk.

103
06:36.510 --> 06:37.490
I'll go with you.

104
06:37.520 --> 06:39.250
No, I'll be right back.

105
07:00.270 --> 07:01.070
Wenying.

106
07:03.240 --> 07:04.310
It's so late.

107
07:05.360 --> 07:06.870
Why are you not taking care of yourself?

108
07:06.870 --> 07:09.240
You look terrible right now.

109
07:10.510 --> 07:11.360
Was Chen Fu...

110
07:13.270 --> 07:14.630
killed by you?

111
07:23.510 --> 07:25.310
Wenying, you really are sick.

112
07:25.310 --> 07:26.950
Are you out of your mind?

113
07:27.040 --> 07:28.030
Think about it.

114
07:28.050 --> 07:30.040
We've known each other for so many years

115
07:30.040 --> 07:31.970
and been through so much together.

116
07:32.270 --> 07:34.240
I've always trusted you.

117
07:35.070 --> 07:36.930
Did it really have to come to this?

118
07:38.480 --> 07:40.159
After I called you,

119
07:40.950 --> 07:43.010
Chen Fu was called out.

120
07:43.120 --> 07:44.190
I saw with my own eyes

121
07:44.190 --> 07:45.800
that he got into Sun Jie's car.

122
07:45.800 --> 07:47.120
You sent him.

123
07:47.120 --> 07:48.800
You and Sun Jie

124
07:48.800 --> 07:50.190
-killed him to silence him! -Zhang Wenying!

125
07:50.190 --> 07:52.590
You need to be responsible for what you say!

126
07:53.430 --> 07:54.830
Chen passed away, and you're sick.

127
07:54.830 --> 07:56.070
I've been tolerant,

128
07:56.070 --> 07:56.780
but that doesn't mean

129
07:56.780 --> 07:58.909
you can be presumptuous in front of me!

130
08:00.720 --> 08:01.950
Let me tell you!

131
08:02.750 --> 08:04.970
I never wanted to kill Chen Fu.

132
08:10.000 --> 08:10.800
Ying.

133
08:11.270 --> 08:12.510
We can't let Dad

134
08:12.680 --> 08:13.800
be wronged like this.

135
08:13.800 --> 08:15.160
We have to take action.

136
08:15.270 --> 08:16.360
What do you think?

137
08:17.600 --> 08:19.140
Based on the recording

138
08:19.310 --> 08:20.870
and Dad's unusual reaction

139
08:20.870 --> 08:22.390
when he took me to the site that day,

140
08:22.390 --> 08:23.190
I suspect

141
08:23.510 --> 08:24.600
Wan Yang and his men took

142
08:24.600 --> 08:26.360
the expensive alloy steel flanges

143
08:26.360 --> 08:27.240
and replaced them

144
08:27.240 --> 08:28.430
with cheap carbon steel ones,

145
08:28.430 --> 08:29.360
causing the explosion

146
08:29.360 --> 08:30.360
that killed Dad.

147
08:30.430 --> 08:32.909
But these are just my guesses.

148
08:33.440 --> 08:34.840
If we call the police now,

149
08:35.030 --> 08:36.120
Wan Yang and his men might take

150
08:36.120 --> 08:37.200
the defective flanges

151
08:37.200 --> 08:39.730
and destroy them all to cover up the evidence.

152
08:40.080 --> 08:40.789
By then,

153
08:40.870 --> 08:42.270
it will be even harder

154
08:42.390 --> 08:43.520
to clear Dad's name.

155
08:45.320 --> 08:47.050
We can't let Dad take the blame.

156
08:48.030 --> 08:50.290
We have to find a way to find out the truth.

157
08:50.670 --> 08:51.630
Then we need to find

158
08:51.630 --> 08:53.870
the defective flanges as soon as possible,

159
08:53.870 --> 08:55.790
as well as Dad's work notes.

160
08:56.600 --> 08:57.240
Yes.

161
08:57.750 --> 08:59.270
I made the call that day.

162
09:00.600 --> 09:02.390
I sent Sun Jie to pick him up.

163
09:02.960 --> 09:03.870
You said Chen

164
09:03.870 --> 09:05.470
found the pipeline problem.

165
09:05.750 --> 09:07.480
I wanted to talk to him in person

166
09:08.000 --> 09:09.020
and ask him not to report it.

167
09:09.020 --> 09:10.550
That wouldn't be good for anyone.

168
09:10.550 --> 09:12.080
But before he could arrive here,

169
09:12.080 --> 09:13.130
he received a call

170
09:13.150 --> 09:14.440
from the construction team,

171
09:14.440 --> 09:15.320
saying there was another

172
09:15.320 --> 09:16.440
hidden safety hazard.

173
09:16.440 --> 09:17.510
He immediately got out of the car

174
09:17.510 --> 09:18.750
and went to the site for inspection.

175
09:18.750 --> 09:19.960
I thought after he finished his business,

176
09:19.960 --> 09:21.320
he would come back to me.

177
09:21.360 --> 09:23.670
Who would have thought Chen Fu would die?

178
09:26.750 --> 09:27.640
Let me tell you

179
09:27.660 --> 09:29.060
a simple truth, Wenying.

180
09:30.120 --> 09:31.000
As you know,

181
09:31.200 --> 09:33.200
I don't know much about technology.

182
09:33.670 --> 09:34.510
How was I supposed to know

183
09:34.510 --> 09:36.510
when and where

184
09:36.510 --> 09:38.040
to make the pipeline explode

185
09:38.040 --> 09:39.700
just as Chen Fu was passing by?

186
09:43.510 --> 09:44.600
This explosion,

187
09:44.670 --> 09:46.390
like the previous ones,

188
09:46.960 --> 09:48.890
was just an engineering accident.

189
09:49.120 --> 09:50.180
It was an accident.

190
10:01.360 --> 10:02.120
Shan,

191
10:02.440 --> 10:03.700
did you find anything?

192
10:05.550 --> 10:07.560
Before inspecting the site,

193
10:07.790 --> 10:09.420
they must have cleaned it up.

194
10:09.750 --> 10:11.630
They cleaned it up completely,

195
10:12.120 --> 10:13.630
leaving no trace at all.

196
10:15.480 --> 10:16.480
Think about where else

197
10:16.480 --> 10:17.680
there could be clues.

198
10:19.750 --> 10:21.080
There is one more place.

199
10:23.790 --> 10:25.150
I'm about to retire.

200
10:26.030 --> 10:27.720
I need a smooth landing.

201
10:28.270 --> 10:29.930
Why would I get myself

202
10:29.960 --> 10:31.320
into so much trouble?

203
10:36.000 --> 10:37.200
Before the accident,

204
10:37.270 --> 10:39.360
you asked me to suggest a remedy.

205
10:40.390 --> 10:41.520
I've made up my mind.

206
10:42.320 --> 10:43.920
Maybe I should listen to you.

207
10:44.750 --> 10:45.750
Over the years,

208
10:47.150 --> 10:49.210
everyone has gotten to know you well.

209
10:49.550 --> 10:51.350
You never stand in anyone's way.

210
10:51.510 --> 10:53.910
You work hard and ask for nothing in return.

211
10:54.200 --> 10:56.260
You have a lot of respect in the plant.

212
10:56.320 --> 10:57.150
I promise

213
10:57.750 --> 11:00.000
I will definitely help you before I retire,

214
11:00.000 --> 11:01.550
so you can be more than just

215
11:02.320 --> 11:04.050
a design department director.

216
11:08.510 --> 11:09.840
But you shouldn't

217
11:09.840 --> 11:11.980
let Chen take the blame.

218
11:12.320 --> 11:15.000
Chen had been a decent man all his life.

219
11:15.150 --> 11:16.510
You can't let him

220
11:16.510 --> 11:18.510
have a bad reputation after he dies.

221
11:19.000 --> 11:20.320
I know you're sad,

222
11:22.030 --> 11:23.630
but Chen is gone.

223
11:23.840 --> 11:24.790
Sacrificing him

224
11:24.790 --> 11:28.200
would be the best outcome for everyone.

225
11:32.510 --> 11:34.240
Chen Ying is still in the plant.

226
11:34.630 --> 11:35.960
In the future, Chen Shan

227
11:36.510 --> 11:38.840
will also need to come in and make a living.

228
11:41.490 --> 11:44.350
You have to think about your children's future.

229
12:14.510 --> 12:15.750
Hurry, pack it up.

230
12:17.030 --> 12:17.720
Let's go.

231
12:17.720 --> 12:18.360
Let's go.

232
12:23.630 --> 12:24.490
Zhang Wenying.

233
12:27.000 --> 12:28.720
This time, when the flanges were changed,

234
12:28.720 --> 12:31.120
although you didn't put anything in your pocket,

235
12:31.120 --> 12:33.440
you knowingly assisted.

236
12:34.360 --> 12:35.760
Besides, over the years,

237
12:35.840 --> 12:38.030
whenever you asked for something,

238
12:38.150 --> 12:39.600
I agreed if I could.

239
12:39.750 --> 12:40.750
To put it bluntly,

240
12:41.390 --> 12:43.510
we are in the same boat.

241
12:43.840 --> 12:45.240
Once something happens,

242
12:46.120 --> 12:47.600
we're all doomed.

243
12:50.510 --> 12:52.570
Go back and think about it carefully.

244
12:53.080 --> 12:53.960
I believe

245
12:54.960 --> 12:56.440
you'll figure it out.

246
13:05.720 --> 13:07.720
The meeting on the Project 713 accident

247
13:05.870 --> 13:12.160
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

248
13:07.720 --> 13:08.960
will be held at 2:00 PM

249
13:08.960 --> 13:10.720
in the plant cafeteria.

250
13:10.960 --> 13:13.080
Department heads should strengthen their study

251
13:12.250 --> 13:16.660
[Staff Cafeteria]

252
13:13.080 --> 13:14.510
of safety regulations in the future.

253
13:14.510 --> 13:16.750
Every Friday at 3:00 PM, there will be

254
13:16.750 --> 13:19.360
safety training in the plant cafeteria.

255
13:19.360 --> 13:21.510
Please attend on time.

256
13:21.510 --> 13:23.240
No one from the Chen family came.

257
13:23.240 --> 13:25.240
I guess Zhang Wenying has completely figured it out

258
13:25.240 --> 13:26.770
and persuaded the two kids.

259
13:28.120 --> 13:28.960
Let's begin.

260
13:36.720 --> 13:37.600
Quiet down, everyone!

261
13:37.600 --> 13:38.200
Stop talking!

262
13:38.200 --> 13:39.400
The Director is here!

263
13:48.150 --> 13:48.960
Everyone.

264
13:50.510 --> 13:51.270
Today, we're holding

265
13:51.270 --> 13:53.480
an internal self-inspection meeting

266
13:53.960 --> 13:55.890
regarding the pipeline explosion

267
13:56.510 --> 13:59.720
at the Wuxin Section of Project 713.

268
14:00.480 --> 14:02.360
If anyone has any concerns or requests,

269
14:02.360 --> 14:04.440
let's put everything on the table

270
14:04.440 --> 14:05.360
and make things clear.

271
14:05.360 --> 14:08.200
We'll report all the problems and potential risks we uncover

272
14:06.540 --> 14:07.160
[Project 713 Pipeline Explosion]

273
14:07.190 --> 14:08.540
[Investigation and Accountability Meeting]

274
14:08.670 --> 14:11.320
to the accident investigation team truthfully.

275
14:11.320 --> 14:12.510
Let me start.

276
14:13.200 --> 14:14.200
Over the past few days,

277
14:14.200 --> 14:15.600
our supply department has conducted

278
14:15.600 --> 14:17.750
a thorough internal review

279
14:17.910 --> 14:20.150
and issued a self-inspection report.

280
14:20.200 --> 14:21.600
I can tell you

281
14:21.600 --> 14:22.800
with full confidence

282
14:23.080 --> 14:24.390
that our department's

283
14:24.600 --> 14:27.030
equipment quality and inventory list

284
14:27.440 --> 14:28.270
have both

285
14:28.270 --> 14:29.600
stood up to scrutiny.

286
14:29.790 --> 14:32.320
There's absolutely nothing wrong with them.

287
14:32.430 --> 14:34.600
I've only recently taken over the design department.

288
14:34.600 --> 14:35.840
So far,

289
14:35.910 --> 14:36.720
I haven't found

290
14:36.720 --> 14:37.850
any major problems.

291
14:38.080 --> 14:39.600
If anything comes up later,

292
14:39.600 --> 14:40.840
I'll report it

293
14:40.840 --> 14:41.750
immediately.

294
14:46.720 --> 14:48.270
I am the deputy captain of the construction team,

295
14:48.270 --> 14:49.120
He Jianchuan.

296
14:49.240 --> 14:50.910
As for the construction team's affairs,

297
14:50.910 --> 14:52.270
I rarely get involved.

298
14:52.270 --> 14:55.510
Captain Chen was the one making all the decisions.

299
14:56.630 --> 14:58.830
He just wants to shirk responsibility.

300
14:59.480 --> 15:00.410
What did you say?

301
15:01.320 --> 15:02.150
I said

302
15:02.150 --> 15:03.960
he is shirking responsibility.

303
15:04.030 --> 15:06.240
-Right! -Right!

304
15:06.670 --> 15:09.720
I have a self-inspection appraisal report here.

305
15:13.480 --> 15:14.960
I swear on my honor

306
15:15.790 --> 15:17.240
that this explosion

307
15:17.270 --> 15:20.840
was caused by Captain Chen's

308
15:20.910 --> 15:22.110
improper operation.

309
15:23.790 --> 15:25.240
Our Captain Chen was known

310
15:25.240 --> 15:27.170
for his competence and integrity.

311
15:27.200 --> 15:28.450
He had always put safety

312
15:28.450 --> 15:29.510
first!

313
15:29.510 --> 15:29.960
Right!

314
15:29.960 --> 15:30.390
Our Captain Chen

315
15:30.390 --> 15:31.960
had absolutely no problems.

316
15:31.960 --> 15:32.840
Anyone who accuses him

317
15:32.840 --> 15:33.670
is framing him!

318
15:33.670 --> 15:34.670
Am I right, everyone?

319
15:34.670 --> 15:35.480
Right!

320
15:35.520 --> 15:36.770
It's a frame-up!

321
15:38.270 --> 15:38.840
Exactly!

322
15:39.480 --> 15:40.700
Whoever has evidence

323
15:40.880 --> 15:42.150
can bring it out.

324
15:42.600 --> 15:44.180
Let's confront each other face to face.

325
15:44.180 --> 15:45.670
Is that okay?

326
15:49.480 --> 15:50.510
This appraisal

327
15:51.270 --> 15:52.790
is very detailed.

328
15:53.720 --> 15:56.360
Does anyone else have evidence to provide?

329
16:00.240 --> 16:02.080
Alright, since there's none, then...

330
16:02.080 --> 16:03.090
I have evidence!

331
16:06.870 --> 16:08.000
These past few days,

332
16:08.240 --> 16:09.260
we visited the hospital

333
16:09.260 --> 16:10.660
and the family quarters.

334
16:10.960 --> 16:12.690
This is a collective statement

335
16:14.240 --> 16:15.960
-from the workers at the hospital. -Director Wan.

336
16:15.960 --> 16:17.120
They can prove

337
16:17.240 --> 16:19.320
that my father's construction work

338
16:19.510 --> 16:20.750
was fully compliant with the procedures

339
16:20.750 --> 16:21.750
and had no issues.

340
16:22.750 --> 16:23.780
Take a look.

341
16:24.080 --> 16:25.340
Everyone, take a look!

342
16:25.790 --> 16:27.670
One or two people saying it might not be credible,

343
16:27.670 --> 16:29.170
but if everyone says so,

344
16:29.240 --> 16:30.510
my dad was definitely innocent!

345
16:30.510 --> 16:31.200
Right!

346
16:30.850 --> 16:32.040
[Project 713 Pipeline Explosion]

347
16:31.870 --> 16:33.560
You can't blame us every time something goes wrong!

348
16:32.070 --> 16:32.710
[Investigation and Accountability Meeting]

349
16:33.630 --> 16:35.790
What kind of evidence is this?

350
16:36.320 --> 16:38.050
You are just acting on emotion.

351
16:38.320 --> 16:39.510
You just put people's words

352
16:39.510 --> 16:41.080
in writing.

353
16:41.080 --> 16:42.440
Acting on emotion?

354
16:42.480 --> 16:43.520
Nonsense!

355
16:43.870 --> 16:44.670
You...

356
16:46.390 --> 16:48.190
Even with witness testimonies,

357
16:48.510 --> 16:50.420
without physical evidence to back them up,

358
16:50.420 --> 16:52.060
they're not enough.

359
16:52.080 --> 16:53.840
If you have evidence, please hand it over.

360
16:53.840 --> 16:55.080
If you don't have evidence

361
16:55.080 --> 16:56.320
and want to make a scene here,

362
16:56.320 --> 16:57.080
I'm telling you,

363
16:57.080 --> 16:58.870
our plant will absolutely not tolerate

364
16:58.870 --> 16:59.870
anyone disrupting order

365
16:59.870 --> 17:00.720
here!

366
17:00.750 --> 17:01.550
Security!

367
17:02.200 --> 17:03.260
What should you do?

368
17:03.670 --> 17:04.829
What are you waiting for?

369
17:04.829 --> 17:05.960
Kick them out! Kick them out!

370
17:05.960 --> 17:06.480
How dare you!

371
17:06.480 --> 17:07.160
Don't move!

372
17:07.160 --> 17:07.920
Get out!

373
17:07.920 --> 17:08.960
-Don't move! -Get out!

374
17:08.960 --> 17:09.510
Don't move!

375
17:09.510 --> 17:10.790
-Let go of me! -Don't move!

376
17:10.790 --> 17:11.990
I have more evidence!

377
17:12.030 --> 17:12.829
Let go!

378
17:14.310 --> 17:15.790
This is my dad Chen Fu's

379
17:15.790 --> 17:17.040
work notebook.

380
17:18.240 --> 17:19.160
In it,

381
17:20.109 --> 17:22.510
he kept detailed records of his inspections

382
17:22.510 --> 17:24.710
of the pipe parts before the explosion!

383
17:25.000 --> 17:26.329
If you don't believe me,

384
17:26.510 --> 17:27.400
I'll read it to you right here,

385
17:27.400 --> 17:28.960
line by line!

386
17:29.030 --> 17:29.960
Shan, Shan.

387
17:29.960 --> 17:30.680
Let's... Let's...

388
17:30.680 --> 17:31.940
Don't try to stop me!

389
17:32.400 --> 17:33.600
You have gone too far!

390
17:34.270 --> 17:35.330
Listen carefully!

391
17:35.750 --> 17:37.830
July 17, 1997...

392
17:37.830 --> 17:39.590
-Shan! Shan! -Shan.

393
17:39.590 --> 17:39.980
Ying!

394
17:40.010 --> 17:40.920
Shan!

395
17:41.310 --> 17:42.370
Your dad and I have worked in the plant

396
17:42.370 --> 17:43.160
our whole lives.

397
17:43.160 --> 17:44.850
The plant has been good to us!

398
17:51.200 --> 17:52.650
I won't allow you

399
17:53.960 --> 17:56.620
to make a scene in front of everyone in the plant!

400
18:01.880 --> 18:02.960
The plant will give us a

401
18:02.960 --> 18:03.880
fair...

402
18:05.110 --> 18:06.550
fair resolution.

403
18:09.070 --> 18:10.490
I'm making a scene?

404
18:11.160 --> 18:13.220
I'm helping Dad prove his innocence!

405
18:14.590 --> 18:15.590
Senior! Senior!

406
18:15.590 --> 18:16.350
Don't...

407
18:16.510 --> 18:17.840
Don't... don't hit him.

408
18:19.830 --> 18:20.540
Mom!

409
18:20.640 --> 18:21.510
Call an ambulance!

410
18:21.510 --> 18:22.110
Call an ambulance!

411
18:22.110 --> 18:22.770
Ambulance!

412
18:23.350 --> 18:24.100
Mom!

413
18:24.160 --> 18:24.880
Go make a call!

414
18:24.880 --> 18:25.680
Make a call!

415
18:25.710 --> 18:26.770
Call an ambulance!

416
18:43.490 --> 18:47.670
[Inpatient Department]

417
19:02.440 --> 19:03.240
Well...

418
19:05.590 --> 19:06.630
Ying, Shan.

419
19:06.650 --> 19:09.000
Well... the plant has agreed

420
19:09.030 --> 19:10.290
to investigate again,

421
19:11.640 --> 19:14.570
and the responsibility will be determined in 3 days.

422
19:14.920 --> 19:16.310
I totally understand that you two

423
19:16.310 --> 19:17.350
want to help your dad

424
19:17.350 --> 19:18.480
prove his innocence.

425
19:18.480 --> 19:19.200
You are both

426
19:19.200 --> 19:20.310
good kids.

427
19:20.920 --> 19:22.400
But for now,

428
19:22.590 --> 19:24.520
you should just stay with your mom.

429
19:28.310 --> 19:29.070
Why did my mom

430
19:29.070 --> 19:30.350
stop me today?

431
19:35.830 --> 19:37.490
Why wouldn't she let me speak?

432
19:38.160 --> 19:39.080
Shan,

433
19:39.640 --> 19:41.580
you just graduated from college.

434
19:42.110 --> 19:43.960
Adults' work

435
19:43.980 --> 19:45.570
can be very complicated.

436
19:46.590 --> 19:47.550
Especially for your mom.

437
19:47.550 --> 19:49.000
In her position,

438
19:49.000 --> 19:49.640
many things

439
19:49.640 --> 19:51.550
aren't easy, and she has no choice.

440
19:51.550 --> 19:52.400
And it's not entirely

441
19:52.400 --> 19:53.790
up to your mom.

442
19:54.510 --> 19:55.510
Because things at work

443
19:55.510 --> 19:57.710
are all about weighing the pros and cons

444
19:57.830 --> 19:59.290
and being in the same boat.

445
20:02.830 --> 20:04.510
Let me tell you,

446
20:05.030 --> 20:05.830
about this matter,

447
20:05.830 --> 20:07.550
if you keep investigating it,

448
20:08.030 --> 20:08.960
it won't do you

449
20:08.960 --> 20:09.680
or your mom

450
20:09.680 --> 20:10.790
any good.

451
20:11.750 --> 20:13.550
Shan, listen... listen to me.

452
20:13.920 --> 20:15.000
Listen to me.

453
20:15.000 --> 20:16.230
Your mom can't take it right now.

454
20:16.230 --> 20:18.230
Her body can't take any more of this.

455
20:18.680 --> 20:19.550
Okay, Shan?

456
20:19.880 --> 20:21.410
As for your investigation,

457
20:21.550 --> 20:22.750
put it on hold for now.

458
20:23.030 --> 20:24.110
Do it for your mom.

459
20:24.510 --> 20:25.510
Well, I...

460
20:39.490 --> 20:43.700
[Nurses' Station]

461
20:41.510 --> 20:42.070
Hello.

462
20:42.240 --> 20:43.440
Which ward is Hu Zhe in?

463
20:43.440 --> 20:44.400
Let me check.

464
20:44.960 --> 20:45.750
Ying.

465
20:47.200 --> 20:48.160
I'll go with you.

466
20:52.070 --> 20:54.400
Are we really going to listen to Godfather

467
20:54.400 --> 20:55.750
and just let this go?

468
20:57.270 --> 20:58.640
I get...

469
20:59.440 --> 21:00.640
what he said,

470
21:00.880 --> 21:01.880
and I understand.

471
21:03.030 --> 21:04.790
In a place like the transmission plant,

472
21:04.790 --> 21:06.400
it's all about fitting in

473
21:06.400 --> 21:07.860
and sharing the benefits.

474
21:08.310 --> 21:10.370
Everyone should support each other.

475
21:11.440 --> 21:12.440
Some things

476
21:13.160 --> 21:14.760
aren't just black and white.

477
21:18.510 --> 21:19.770
Does that include Mom?

478
21:27.960 --> 21:28.750
Shan.

479
21:30.480 --> 21:31.750
Mom might be a bit too involved

480
21:31.750 --> 21:33.200
in social niceties,

481
21:34.350 --> 21:35.350
but on major issues

482
21:35.350 --> 21:37.080
of right and wrong, I trust her.

483
21:38.030 --> 21:39.490
She has her own standards.

484
21:39.920 --> 21:41.380
Even if we assume the worst

485
21:41.790 --> 21:43.240
and she actually knew something,

486
21:43.240 --> 21:44.750
she wouldn't get involved.

487
21:44.750 --> 21:45.830
She knows what she should

488
21:45.830 --> 21:47.070
and shouldn't do.

489
21:56.400 --> 21:57.370
Godfather said

490
21:57.750 --> 21:59.280
Wan Yang is planning to hold

491
21:59.440 --> 22:00.750
a meeting in 3 days to determine

492
22:00.750 --> 22:02.280
the cause of the explosion.

493
22:02.310 --> 22:02.920
When the time comes,

494
22:02.920 --> 22:04.790
if they're willing to clear Dad's name,

495
22:04.790 --> 22:05.790
we'll let it go.

496
22:06.480 --> 22:07.480
If they

497
22:08.000 --> 22:09.800
dare to distort the truth again,

498
22:09.960 --> 22:11.820
I'll fight them to the bitter end.

499
22:11.830 --> 22:13.690
Let's wait for the results first.

500
22:23.160 --> 22:26.700
[Three Days Later]

501
22:30.030 --> 22:30.830
Senior.

502
22:31.270 --> 22:32.070
Senior.

503
22:32.640 --> 22:34.350
You're not feeling well.

504
22:34.350 --> 22:35.750
You shouldn't have come.

505
22:35.750 --> 22:36.480
It's fine.

506
22:37.240 --> 22:38.170
I should be here.

507
22:39.240 --> 22:40.070
Okay, okay.

508
22:40.160 --> 22:41.030
Ying, Ying.

509
22:41.200 --> 22:42.640
Remember what I told you

510
22:42.640 --> 22:43.550
at the hospital.

511
22:43.550 --> 22:44.680
Know your limits.

512
22:44.920 --> 22:46.310
Hold... Hold Shan back a bit.

513
22:46.310 --> 22:47.640
Don't worry, Godfather.

514
22:47.640 --> 22:49.040
Shan, it's fine. Go on in.

515
22:49.480 --> 22:50.030
Go in.

516
23:06.680 --> 23:08.180
After gathering data,

517
23:08.480 --> 23:11.200
conducting an investigation, and repeatedly verifying the facts,

518
23:11.200 --> 23:12.200
I hereby announce

519
23:12.550 --> 23:14.310
that the pipeline explosion

520
23:14.400 --> 23:16.330
in the Wuxin section of Project 713

521
23:16.480 --> 23:18.070
had nothing to do with

522
23:18.920 --> 23:21.090
the construction team's operations

523
23:21.680 --> 23:22.830
or the late Captain Chen Fu.

524
23:22.830 --> 23:24.090
-Bravo! -Bravo!

525
23:26.980 --> 23:27.890
Mom.

526
23:31.830 --> 23:33.160
Ms. Zhang Wenying's design

527
23:33.160 --> 23:35.400
for this section of Project 713

528
23:35.920 --> 23:37.510
routed the pipeline through geologically complex strata

529
23:37.510 --> 23:39.310
without proper consideration,

530
23:39.440 --> 23:41.400
then abruptly routed it into the river channel.

531
23:41.400 --> 23:42.550
This caused the temperature

532
23:42.550 --> 23:43.420
of the natural gas inside the pipeline

533
23:43.420 --> 23:45.160
to fluctuate by over 3 degrees within a short period

534
23:45.160 --> 23:46.480
and created

535
23:46.570 --> 23:48.030
pressure differences sufficient

536
23:48.030 --> 23:49.310
to trigger changes in the gas.

537
23:49.310 --> 23:50.970
According to the blueprints,

538
23:51.030 --> 23:53.090
excessive amounts of solid sulfides

539
23:53.880 --> 23:55.740
had accumulated on the pipe walls

540
23:56.270 --> 23:58.960
at the downstream end of the middle section

541
23:59.070 --> 24:00.620
of the filter separators,

542
24:00.750 --> 24:02.150
posing an explosion risk

543
24:02.160 --> 24:04.070
during construction.

544
24:04.920 --> 24:05.720
The design department

545
24:05.720 --> 24:07.050
led by Ms. Zhang Wenying

546
24:07.960 --> 24:09.820
shall bear full responsibility.

547
24:10.250 --> 24:13.270
They are to be handed over to the Project 713 Accident Investigation Team

548
24:13.270 --> 24:15.200
to assist with the investigation.

549
24:15.400 --> 24:16.530
Meeting adjourned.

550
24:17.000 --> 24:18.000
Director Wan.

551
24:18.400 --> 24:20.750
We don't accept this conclusion.

552
24:20.830 --> 24:23.030
We... We demand that technical experts

553
24:23.160 --> 24:24.550
reassess these

554
24:24.550 --> 24:25.550
design blueprints!

555
24:25.550 --> 24:26.310
Right!

556
24:26.400 --> 24:27.960
Well, how is this possible?

557
24:29.350 --> 24:30.790
Reassess?

558
24:31.110 --> 24:32.030
Can you do it?

559
24:32.310 --> 24:33.070
I can.

560
24:33.330 --> 24:34.390
[Project 713 Pipeline Explosion]

561
24:34.420 --> 24:36.280
[Investigation and Accountability Meeting]

562
25:10.750 --> 25:11.550
Director Wan,

563
25:12.880 --> 25:14.410
this is indeed a design plan

564
25:14.510 --> 25:15.550
we worked on

565
25:15.550 --> 25:17.110
in the early stages.

566
25:17.830 --> 25:19.510
But the pipeline route

567
25:19.510 --> 25:20.440
in the final plan

568
25:21.960 --> 25:23.140
is different.

569
25:33.160 --> 25:34.680
I'm the director of the archives department.

570
25:34.680 --> 25:35.680
What he said is impossible.

571
25:35.680 --> 25:37.070
This is the final version.

572
25:37.070 --> 25:38.130
I personally watched it

573
25:38.130 --> 25:39.000
being sealed into the file bag.

574
25:39.000 --> 25:39.960
How is that possible?

575
25:39.960 --> 25:41.070
Look at it.

576
25:41.160 --> 25:42.240
This pipeline route

577
25:42.240 --> 25:43.550
is not the one in our final plan.

578
25:43.550 --> 25:44.640
So you mean

579
25:44.720 --> 25:47.120
I'm deliberately framing Director Zhang?

580
25:58.480 --> 25:59.590
We can ask our colleagues in the design department...

581
25:59.590 --> 26:00.590
It is...

582
26:00.590 --> 26:01.590
Stop arguing.

583
26:02.070 --> 26:04.000
Director Zhang happens to be here.

584
26:04.160 --> 26:05.510
Let her speak.

585
26:18.550 --> 26:20.010
This is the final version.

586
26:26.480 --> 26:29.160
I will resign as director of the design department

587
26:29.160 --> 26:32.030
and take full responsibility for the explosion

588
26:32.030 --> 26:33.310
in the Wuxin section of Project 713.

589
26:33.310 --> 26:34.070
Mom!

590
26:35.480 --> 26:36.310
Master, this...

591
26:36.310 --> 26:38.160
-Qi. -It's not the final version!

592
26:38.160 --> 26:39.110
-We... -Qi.

593
26:39.750 --> 26:40.830
Say no more.

594
26:41.160 --> 26:42.440
I am the project leader.

595
26:42.440 --> 26:43.790
My signature is on it.

596
26:43.790 --> 26:45.250
You have no right to speak.

597
27:06.160 --> 27:07.440
I'm downstairs.

598
27:15.440 --> 27:16.640
As for the explosion,

599
27:18.070 --> 27:20.270
we'd already agreed on how to handle it.

600
27:20.270 --> 27:21.350
But those two kids

601
27:21.350 --> 27:22.950
brought it out into the open.

602
27:23.750 --> 27:24.590
Now,

603
27:25.200 --> 27:28.130
we can no longer use Chen Fu's improper construction

604
27:28.590 --> 27:29.550
as an excuse.

605
27:30.240 --> 27:31.030
Director,

606
27:31.830 --> 27:33.630
I didn't know they would do that.

607
27:35.750 --> 27:37.030
Standing up for parents

608
27:37.030 --> 27:38.350
is human nature.

609
27:38.920 --> 27:40.360
But you should understand

610
27:40.360 --> 27:41.630
the stakes involved.

611
27:42.070 --> 27:43.670
If they keep investigating,

612
27:43.680 --> 27:45.540
both you and I will be implicated.

613
27:46.720 --> 27:48.310
The best way

614
27:49.830 --> 27:51.430
to handle this explosion now

615
27:52.310 --> 27:54.400
is for someone to take the blame.

616
27:55.680 --> 27:57.160
If the dead can't take it,

617
27:57.640 --> 27:59.400
then the living must.

618
28:00.030 --> 28:01.670
You mean me?

619
28:02.160 --> 28:04.310
If you're willing to take the blame for this,

620
28:04.310 --> 28:06.400
at most you'll be suspended and transferred.

621
28:06.400 --> 28:07.880
You'll be sent to the city first

622
28:07.880 --> 28:09.400
for review by the investigation team.

623
28:09.400 --> 28:10.550
I'll try to get you

624
28:11.110 --> 28:12.570
disciplined internally.

625
28:14.160 --> 28:15.200
No, Director Wan.

626
28:15.400 --> 28:17.730
We're pushing through reforms this year.

627
28:17.920 --> 28:18.880
If I take this responsibility,

628
28:18.880 --> 28:20.110
I will be affected.

629
28:20.110 --> 28:21.240
I don't care about myself,

630
28:21.240 --> 28:23.160
but I have two children to think about.

631
28:23.160 --> 28:24.190
Zhang Wenying.

632
28:26.480 --> 28:27.110
Don't you think

633
28:27.110 --> 28:28.880
it's time to repay the debt

634
28:28.880 --> 28:30.150
you owe

635
28:31.720 --> 28:33.580
Chen Ying's biological parents?

636
28:48.290 --> 28:49.400
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

637
28:49.350 --> 28:49.960
Mom!

638
28:49.960 --> 28:50.640
Don't come any closer!

639
28:50.640 --> 28:51.110
Mom!

640
28:51.110 --> 28:52.680
Go back to work! Go back to work!

641
28:52.680 --> 28:53.510
Stop gawking!

642
28:53.510 --> 28:54.110
Mom!

643
28:54.590 --> 28:55.440
Stop gawking!

644
28:55.480 --> 28:56.000
Mom!

645
28:56.000 --> 28:57.110
Let go of my mom!

646
28:57.110 --> 28:58.030
Don't touch my mom!

647
28:58.030 --> 28:59.740
-You can't take my mom away! -Don't touch my mom!

648
28:59.740 --> 29:00.220
Move!

649
29:00.960 --> 29:02.640
-Mom! Mom! -Mom!

650
29:02.660 --> 29:03.980
-Mom! -Say something!

651
29:04.510 --> 29:05.380
Stop the car!

652
29:06.030 --> 29:06.590
Mom!

653
29:07.790 --> 29:09.000
Don't take my mom away!

654
29:09.000 --> 29:09.700
Mom!

655
29:09.720 --> 29:11.130
Don't take my mom away!

656
29:11.930 --> 29:12.600
Mom!

657
29:13.480 --> 29:14.240
Stop the car!

658
29:44.550 --> 29:45.160
Ying.

659
29:46.270 --> 29:46.870
I want to know

660
29:46.870 --> 29:47.920
why Mom admitted to

661
29:47.920 --> 29:49.320
the things she didn't do.

662
29:53.110 --> 29:54.310
Is there some secret

663
29:55.750 --> 29:56.720
between

664
29:56.720 --> 29:58.070
her and Wan Yang?

665
30:01.790 --> 30:02.590
Shan.

666
30:04.930 --> 30:06.860
What exactly are you trying to say?

667
30:08.550 --> 30:09.650
When Dad came back that day,

668
30:09.650 --> 30:11.550
he obviously noticed something was wrong.

669
30:11.550 --> 30:13.510
He must have told Mom when he got home.

670
30:13.510 --> 30:15.590
Mom was on edge all night.

671
30:17.960 --> 30:18.660
I don't know

672
30:18.690 --> 30:20.270
if Wan Yang is threatening Mom

673
30:20.270 --> 30:21.880
or if Mom is deliberately...

674
30:22.030 --> 30:22.790
hiding something for him.

675
30:22.790 --> 30:23.270
Why won't she

676
30:23.270 --> 30:24.480
tell us anything?

677
30:24.480 --> 30:25.810
Have you lost your mind?

678
30:26.160 --> 30:28.400
You've been acting strange since yesterday.

679
30:28.400 --> 30:28.920
What on earth

680
30:28.920 --> 30:29.920
are you thinking?

681
30:29.920 --> 30:31.380
How could you suspect Mom?

682
30:38.830 --> 30:40.080
[Design Department]

683
30:41.750 --> 30:43.010
Deputy Director Feng.

684
30:43.790 --> 30:44.590
Busy?

685
30:44.920 --> 30:45.810
We've got orders from above.

686
30:45.810 --> 30:46.830
Zhang Wenying's office

687
30:46.830 --> 30:48.110
needs to be sealed off.

688
30:48.790 --> 30:50.110
Do it!

689
30:50.110 --> 30:50.830
Don't!

690
30:51.640 --> 30:52.350
Wait a moment.

691
30:52.350 --> 30:54.000
I have things there.

692
30:54.000 --> 30:54.790
Your things?

693
30:54.790 --> 30:55.350
Come on.

694
30:55.350 --> 30:56.750
Go fetch them.

695
30:57.790 --> 30:59.000
Don't go inside.

696
30:59.160 --> 31:00.160
What does it have to do with you?

697
31:00.160 --> 31:02.160
-No, they don't know... -Hurry up! Hurry up!

698
31:02.160 --> 31:03.310
My box...

699
31:03.350 --> 31:04.160
We'll get everything out for you.

700
31:04.160 --> 31:04.880
We'll get everything out for you.

701
31:04.880 --> 31:05.940
Here, here.

702
31:06.160 --> 31:06.960
But... I...

703
31:06.960 --> 31:07.880
-Okay. -Here.

704
31:08.880 --> 31:09.910
Seal it.

705
31:09.960 --> 31:11.000
Don't! Wait a moment!

706
31:11.000 --> 31:11.510
What are you doing?

707
31:11.510 --> 31:12.070
What are you doing?

708
31:12.070 --> 31:13.680
Wait! That box...

709
31:13.680 --> 31:14.750
You took my box out.

710
31:14.750 --> 31:16.000
But I haven't taken my washbasin out yet.

711
31:16.000 --> 31:16.960
Here. See?

712
31:17.110 --> 31:17.850
This is my...

713
31:18.240 --> 31:18.740
Hurry!

714
31:18.760 --> 31:19.580
Hurry!

715
31:19.960 --> 31:21.030
What are you doing?

716
31:21.030 --> 31:21.550
No, this is mine.

717
31:21.550 --> 31:22.440
Can you take this?

718
31:22.440 --> 31:23.310
This is public property.

719
31:23.310 --> 31:24.110
No, this is my personal...

720
31:24.110 --> 31:24.510
Go. Go.

721
31:24.520 --> 31:25.160
Leave.

722
31:25.280 --> 31:26.920
-That's my personal... -That's enough.

723
31:26.920 --> 31:27.640
Your personal property?

724
31:27.640 --> 31:29.030
Seal it!

725
31:31.270 --> 31:31.960
Well...

726
31:34.750 --> 31:35.480
Mr. Qi.

727
31:36.350 --> 31:38.000
You've been here for ten years,

728
31:38.000 --> 31:39.930
and you don't even have a dorm room?

729
31:40.550 --> 31:41.540
Ridiculous.

730
31:41.720 --> 31:43.850
We're leaving, Deputy Director Feng.

731
31:50.240 --> 31:52.030
He used to have Master to protect him.

732
31:52.030 --> 31:53.510
Now he's completely done for.

733
31:53.510 --> 31:54.880
Let's see if he can still act tough.

734
31:54.880 --> 31:55.960
Stop talking.

735
31:56.920 --> 31:57.880
Ying, Shan.

736
31:58.680 --> 31:59.350
Godfather?

737
31:59.350 --> 32:00.350
You're home, huh?

738
32:00.480 --> 32:01.590
Where is Shan?

739
32:02.680 --> 32:03.310
Godfather.

740
32:03.310 --> 32:04.920
I was just packing some things

741
32:04.920 --> 32:06.240
to bring to my mom.

742
32:06.260 --> 32:07.310
Don't go. Don't go.

743
32:07.310 --> 32:08.070
I prepared some things

744
32:08.070 --> 32:09.640
and was about to go,

745
32:09.750 --> 32:11.310
but they stopped me.

746
32:11.510 --> 32:12.310
They said visits are not allowed

747
32:12.310 --> 32:13.640
during this time.

748
32:14.200 --> 32:15.010
Come on. Come on.

749
32:15.010 --> 32:15.910
I bought you some food.

750
32:15.910 --> 32:16.750
Eat up.

751
32:17.680 --> 32:18.750
Come here, Shan. Come.

752
32:18.750 --> 32:20.350
I'm not hungry. You guys eat.

753
32:21.550 --> 32:22.750
Don't get too pissed.

754
32:22.750 --> 32:24.110
You still need to eat.

755
32:25.880 --> 32:26.680
Godfather.

756
32:29.160 --> 32:30.750
We want to get my mom out.

757
32:31.750 --> 32:32.550
Now...

758
32:33.750 --> 32:35.310
they won't even let us see her.

759
32:35.310 --> 32:36.720
We don't know what to do.

760
32:42.240 --> 32:43.920
This guy is really, really awful,

761
32:43.920 --> 32:44.640
you know?

762
32:45.310 --> 32:46.480
Your father is dead,

763
32:46.480 --> 32:46.920
and now

764
32:46.920 --> 32:48.720
he won't even let your mother go.

765
32:51.070 --> 32:52.160
It was actually Wan Yang.

766
32:52.160 --> 32:52.750
The explosion

767
32:52.750 --> 32:54.070
was definitely related

768
32:54.070 --> 32:54.750
to him.

769
32:54.750 --> 32:55.550
I'm sure of it.

770
32:55.550 --> 32:56.720
Just go to Wan Yang.

771
32:56.720 --> 32:57.310
Because I really

772
32:57.310 --> 32:58.640
know this guy too well.

773
32:58.830 --> 32:59.590
He is capable...

774
32:59.590 --> 33:00.790
of doing anything.

775
33:00.790 --> 33:02.160
He used to be in the Northwest.

776
33:02.160 --> 33:03.160
He's been back at this plant

777
33:03.160 --> 33:03.880
for just a short time—

778
33:03.880 --> 33:04.880
over ten years.

779
33:04.880 --> 33:06.110
Look at what he's turned it into!

780
33:06.110 --> 33:07.200
It's a mess now!

781
33:10.110 --> 33:12.170
Thanks for your hard work, everyone.

782
33:12.710 --> 33:14.510
Director, what brings you here?

783
33:14.550 --> 33:15.830
If you need anything, just let me know.

784
33:15.830 --> 33:17.200
I can go to you.

785
33:18.880 --> 33:19.940
Just taking a look.

786
33:22.000 --> 33:22.790
Everyone.

787
33:23.310 --> 33:24.640
I've always emphasized

788
33:24.880 --> 33:26.400
that the design department

789
33:26.400 --> 33:27.920
is the heart of our plant.

790
33:28.640 --> 33:29.440
But now

791
33:30.720 --> 33:32.120
is not the time for grief.

792
33:32.430 --> 33:34.160
We must turn our grief into strength,

793
33:34.160 --> 33:35.620
hurry up with the repairs,

794
33:35.680 --> 33:37.070
redraw the blueprints,

795
33:37.070 --> 33:38.550
correct the mistakes,

796
33:38.750 --> 33:41.310
and rebuild the damaged site.

797
33:41.830 --> 33:42.510
Okay.

798
33:42.830 --> 33:43.780
Director Feng.

799
33:44.480 --> 33:46.160
Although you are the acting director,

800
33:46.160 --> 33:48.200
you have a heavy burden on your shoulders.

801
33:48.200 --> 33:49.440
You have to stay strong.

802
33:49.440 --> 33:50.240
Rest assured.

803
33:50.240 --> 33:51.060
I guarantee

804
33:51.090 --> 33:52.480
we'll complete the repairs to a high standard

805
33:52.480 --> 33:53.350
within 2 months.

806
33:53.350 --> 33:54.160
One month.

807
33:55.160 --> 33:56.420
If you let me handle it,

808
33:56.550 --> 33:57.550
I guarantee

809
33:57.760 --> 33:59.160
we'll get the job done in one month

810
33:59.160 --> 34:00.820
for two-thirds of the budget.

811
34:01.440 --> 34:02.240
Mr. Qi,

812
34:02.440 --> 34:03.750
are you kidding?

813
34:03.790 --> 34:06.190
You have to be responsible for what you say.

814
34:06.750 --> 34:07.680
This project

815
34:07.960 --> 34:09.150
was handled by my master,

816
34:09.150 --> 34:10.360
Zhang Wenying, and me

817
34:10.360 --> 34:11.620
from beginning to end.

818
34:11.800 --> 34:13.090
No one knows this project

819
34:13.090 --> 34:14.020
better than I do.

820
34:15.230 --> 34:16.150
I'm willing

821
34:16.630 --> 34:17.960
to stake my career on it.

822
34:18.150 --> 34:19.610
If I can't get the job done,

823
34:19.670 --> 34:21.000
I'll resign on the spot.

824
34:22.710 --> 34:23.510
Alright.

825
34:23.760 --> 34:24.840
Since Mr. Qi

826
34:25.360 --> 34:27.320
has volunteered and is willing to take responsibility,

827
34:27.320 --> 34:28.320
I hereby announce

828
34:28.630 --> 34:29.500
the immediate formation

829
34:29.500 --> 34:32.070
of the Project 713 Emergency Repair Design Team.

830
34:32.070 --> 34:33.070
Mr. Qi Mo

831
34:33.670 --> 34:34.800
will be the team leader.

832
34:34.800 --> 34:36.800
Everyone else in the design department

833
34:36.800 --> 34:38.230
will be at his disposal

834
34:38.139 --> 34:41.440
[Sealed]

835
34:38.280 --> 34:39.920
and give him their full support.

836
34:39.920 --> 34:40.730
Are you determined

837
34:40.730 --> 34:41.659
to get this done?

838
34:43.440 --> 34:44.230
Yes.

839
34:44.760 --> 34:45.960
We won't let you down.

840
34:48.550 --> 34:49.960
Remember your pledge.

841
34:50.550 --> 34:51.920
If you fail to complete the task,

842
34:51.920 --> 34:53.320
I won't be able to protect you either.

843
34:53.320 --> 34:54.719
Rest assured, Director.

844
34:54.760 --> 34:56.420
I'll be waiting for good news.

845
34:57.780 --> 35:01.100
[Sealed]

846
35:06.880 --> 35:07.880
Mom told me

847
35:08.230 --> 35:09.070
the former director

848
35:09.070 --> 35:10.710
originally wanted you to succeed him,

849
35:10.710 --> 35:12.320
but Wan Yang ruined it.

850
35:12.320 --> 35:13.070
Is that true?

851
35:14.880 --> 35:16.320
Being the director...

852
35:16.550 --> 35:17.630
Whether it's director or deputy director,

853
35:17.630 --> 35:18.150
it means

854
35:18.170 --> 35:19.150
nothing to me.

855
35:20.230 --> 35:22.030
But it's different for Wan Yang.

856
35:22.030 --> 35:22.800
Since he became director,

857
35:22.800 --> 35:24.150
he has been doing

858
35:24.150 --> 35:25.000
all sorts of things

859
35:25.000 --> 35:26.550
to line his pockets at every turn.

860
35:26.550 --> 35:27.320
He'd stop at nothing

861
35:27.320 --> 35:28.710
to make money.

862
35:29.110 --> 35:29.840
He doesn't care whether

863
35:29.840 --> 35:30.760
any part...

864
35:30.760 --> 35:31.590
any part of a project

865
35:31.590 --> 35:32.550
meets...

866
35:32.800 --> 35:33.760
like...

867
35:33.760 --> 35:35.110
safety requirements.

868
35:35.110 --> 35:36.710
He never considers the risks.

869
35:36.710 --> 35:37.760
In engineering,

870
35:37.760 --> 35:39.110
there are no small matters.

871
35:39.110 --> 35:40.000
Every part,

872
35:40.000 --> 35:40.960
from the pipelines

873
35:40.960 --> 35:42.550
to the welds and flanges,

874
35:42.550 --> 35:43.960
has to meet

875
35:43.960 --> 35:45.510
safety standards.

876
35:45.510 --> 35:46.150
Otherwise,

877
35:46.150 --> 35:48.080
an explosion could easily happen.

878
35:49.240 --> 35:50.620
So that's why Dad

879
35:51.110 --> 35:52.360
reacted that way when he saw the flange

880
35:52.360 --> 35:53.480
that day.

881
35:55.230 --> 35:56.110
I get it now.

882
35:57.550 --> 35:58.080
But that

883
35:58.100 --> 35:59.830
flange with the wrong material

884
35:59.920 --> 36:00.920
could be evidence

885
36:00.920 --> 36:02.710
that Wan Yang bought substandard materials

886
36:02.710 --> 36:04.070
at inflated prices?

887
36:04.070 --> 36:04.840
Of course.

888
36:05.480 --> 36:06.280
Godfather.

889
36:06.710 --> 36:07.510
Embezzle—

890
36:08.190 --> 36:10.120
If there really was embezzlement,

891
36:10.440 --> 36:11.320
the...

892
36:12.440 --> 36:14.110
the procurement department

893
36:14.110 --> 36:14.760
would have to be involved.

894
36:14.760 --> 36:15.760
Sun Jie is in charge of purchasing

895
36:15.760 --> 36:16.320
at our plant,

896
36:16.320 --> 36:17.190
and everyone knows

897
36:17.190 --> 36:18.920
he's one of the director's men.

898
36:19.510 --> 36:20.360
Could we start...

899
36:20.360 --> 36:22.510
by investigating him?

900
36:23.360 --> 36:24.110
Ying, aren't you

901
36:24.110 --> 36:25.440
about to start work?

902
36:25.440 --> 36:26.110
Once you start work,

903
36:26.110 --> 36:27.150
keep your eyes open

904
36:27.150 --> 36:28.280
in the supply department.

905
36:28.280 --> 36:30.070
You'll definitely spot some clues.

906
36:30.070 --> 36:31.200
You know what I mean?

907
36:34.920 --> 36:36.000
Also, there's that guy...

908
36:36.000 --> 36:36.760
That Sun Jie

909
36:36.760 --> 36:38.360
has a subordinate, called...

910
36:38.360 --> 36:39.320
The head of the transport team,

911
36:39.320 --> 36:40.070
Liu Jun.

912
36:41.400 --> 36:43.000
He's Wan Yang's brother-in-law.

913
36:43.000 --> 36:43.800
He's...

914
36:43.800 --> 36:45.050
always there.

915
36:45.080 --> 36:46.110
He's in the plant

916
36:46.110 --> 36:46.550
all the time.

917
36:46.550 --> 36:47.360
And he...

918
36:47.360 --> 36:48.560
He's not very bright.

919
36:48.590 --> 36:49.400
We can...

920
36:49.550 --> 36:51.070
We can start with him.

921
36:53.280 --> 36:55.760
Liu Jun works in transportation.

922
36:56.550 --> 36:59.410
The construction site is under tight security now.

923
36:59.550 --> 37:00.900
My sister and I almost got caught

924
37:00.900 --> 37:02.070
when we went there last time.

925
37:02.070 --> 37:03.110
They're bound

926
37:03.440 --> 37:04.970
to be even more careful now.

927
37:06.400 --> 37:07.150
Leave it to me.

928
37:07.150 --> 37:08.230
I'll go find them.

929
37:08.440 --> 37:09.670
I'll go talk to the construction team

930
37:09.670 --> 37:10.930
and get you a job there.

931
37:11.070 --> 37:12.000
That way, you'll be able to

932
37:12.000 --> 37:13.150
come and go more easily.

933
37:13.150 --> 37:14.010
I'll handle it.

934
37:14.760 --> 37:16.290
Will that work, Godfather?

935
37:16.590 --> 37:17.550
I've been the deputy director

936
37:17.550 --> 37:18.550
for so many years.

937
37:18.550 --> 37:19.550
I still have

938
37:19.550 --> 37:20.480
some influence.

939
37:22.070 --> 37:23.190
Leave this to me.

940
37:24.000 --> 37:25.110
Come on. Eat up.

941
37:25.110 --> 37:26.240
Hurry. Eat up. Here.

942
37:33.760 --> 37:34.480
Come in.

943
37:36.880 --> 37:37.670
Sir.

944
37:38.110 --> 37:40.170
Here are the materials you asked for.

945
37:43.480 --> 37:45.740
If you have any grievances, just tell me.

946
37:45.880 --> 37:46.920
Don't hold it in.

947
37:49.110 --> 37:51.070
You must have a better plan, sir.

948
37:51.440 --> 37:53.590
I will execute it unconditionally.

949
37:56.110 --> 37:57.760
I haven't forgotten

950
37:57.920 --> 37:58.780
our agreement.

951
37:58.960 --> 38:00.670
You'll lead

952
38:01.590 --> 38:03.070
the Project 713 restoration.

953
38:03.070 --> 38:04.590
You'll be using Zhang Wenying's blueprints.

954
38:04.590 --> 38:06.480
Once we replace the flanges,

955
38:07.110 --> 38:10.000
you'll officially become director of the design department.

956
38:10.000 --> 38:11.110
You and I both know

957
38:11.550 --> 38:12.840
Qi Mo

958
38:14.230 --> 38:15.320
is a major problem.

959
38:16.190 --> 38:18.110
I hadn't even figured out how to deal with him,

960
38:18.110 --> 38:18.920
and he was already

961
38:18.920 --> 38:20.320
making a move.

962
38:21.360 --> 38:22.660
Zhang Wenying told me

963
38:22.840 --> 38:25.190
about the project details before.

964
38:26.360 --> 38:27.160
There's no way

965
38:28.070 --> 38:29.920
he can finish it in a month.

966
38:31.480 --> 38:32.750
So you're saying

967
38:32.920 --> 38:34.360
we'll corner him when the time comes

968
38:34.360 --> 38:35.110
and get rid of him

969
38:35.110 --> 38:36.320
for good, right?

970
38:36.480 --> 38:38.740
If he can't finish the job, he'll resign.

971
38:39.630 --> 38:41.030
Those were his own words.

972
38:42.320 --> 38:44.450
Let's just sit back and watch the show.

973
38:45.440 --> 38:46.590
You're brilliant.

974
38:49.920 --> 38:51.440
I just can't get it right.

975
38:51.550 --> 38:53.280
It looks so good.

976
38:53.510 --> 38:54.110
Really?

977
38:54.110 --> 38:54.840
Yes.

978
38:55.480 --> 38:56.550
Then it's yours.

979
38:57.070 --> 38:58.360
I'm so honored.

980
39:02.840 --> 39:04.840
I can't embarrass myself like that.

981
39:08.510 --> 39:10.110
Here, try the noodles I made.

982
39:15.920 --> 39:16.520
Director.

983
39:17.150 --> 39:17.630
Okay.

984
39:21.760 --> 39:22.440
Captain He.

985
39:25.920 --> 39:27.180
Deputy Director Geng?

986
39:27.670 --> 39:28.710
What brings you

987
39:28.760 --> 39:30.110
to our construction team today?

988
39:30.110 --> 39:32.170
Nothing. I'm just here to take a look.

989
39:32.750 --> 39:33.690
Keep eating.

990
39:35.360 --> 39:36.800
I'm in a hurry to get to the site.

991
39:36.800 --> 39:37.800
I'll keep eating.

992
39:38.230 --> 39:39.880
What can I do for you?

993
39:43.840 --> 39:44.630
Captain He,

994
39:45.920 --> 39:47.130
you should know

995
39:47.440 --> 39:48.960
that before Captain Chen's accident,

996
39:48.960 --> 39:50.280
he'd already arranged for his son, Chen Shan,

997
39:50.280 --> 39:52.510
to join the construction team.

998
39:52.510 --> 39:53.230
Well,

999
39:53.230 --> 39:53.760
things are

1000
39:53.760 --> 39:55.110
mostly settled now.

1001
39:55.230 --> 39:56.960
Captain He, please do me a favor

1002
39:57.070 --> 39:57.920
and guide him.

1003
40:02.000 --> 40:03.920
It's not that I don't want to do you this favor.

1004
40:03.920 --> 40:05.960
Other things are negotiable,

1005
40:06.150 --> 40:07.550
but this Chen Shan

1006
40:08.960 --> 40:10.880
really can't join the construction team.

1007
40:10.880 --> 40:11.670
Unless...

1008
40:12.800 --> 40:14.400
Director Wan gives the word.

1009
40:14.960 --> 40:15.840
Otherwise,

1010
40:15.960 --> 40:18.220
I really don't have the guts to guide him.

1011
40:21.440 --> 40:22.110
No matter what,

1012
40:22.110 --> 40:23.550
I am the deputy director.

1013
40:23.840 --> 40:24.950
My words...

1014
40:25.760 --> 40:26.550
Wang.

1015
40:27.110 --> 40:28.150
How did you make

1016
40:28.150 --> 40:29.620
these noodles?

1017
40:29.840 --> 40:31.360
The chili has no aroma,

1018
40:31.960 --> 40:32.960
and the flavor is so weak.

1019
40:32.960 --> 40:34.490
It tastes like plain water.

1020
40:34.550 --> 40:35.760
If the noodles

1021
40:36.110 --> 40:36.880
are bad,

1022
40:36.880 --> 40:38.610
you can always buy better ones.

1023
40:39.590 --> 40:41.010
But some people

1024
40:41.110 --> 40:43.230
don't even know their own limits

1025
40:43.350 --> 40:45.550
and still want to tell others what to do.

1026
40:46.110 --> 40:47.480
Isn't that right,

1027
40:47.630 --> 40:48.890
Deputy Director Geng?

1028
40:55.070 --> 40:56.760
I asked Wan Yang today

1029
40:56.800 --> 40:57.800
to let me lead the team

1030
40:57.800 --> 40:59.070
